WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:07.473
And let us dive right in this
week with the 2016 election.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.242
Or as its increasingly known,

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:11.510
America's Fucktastic
Cirque De Dismay.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.611
(AUDIENCE LAUGH)

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:15.281
Now, the big news this week
surrounded Donald Trump,

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:17.816
a punchline that is quickly
becoming a nightmare.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.920
Like if you said,
"Take my wife, please,"

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.456
and then she was actually
kidnapped by ISIS.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.524
-(AUDIENCE LAUGH)
-Now, this week

00:00:25.624 --> 00:00:28.160
revealed a somewhat
startling statistic...

00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:30.396
WOMAN:
<i> A new report from USA Today</i>

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:32.331
<i> found Trump and his businesses</i>

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:35.101
<i> have been involved in
 at least 3,500 lawsuits</i>

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.535
<i> over three decades.</i>

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:39.239
Thirty-five hundred lawsuits!

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:42.408
That is unprecedented
for a presidential nominee.

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:44.810
In fact, if each lawsuit
involving Trump

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.946
were the basis of an episode
of<i> Law &amp; Order,</i>

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:50.750
they could sustain all
456 episodes of the original,

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.020
all 389 episodes
of<i> Law &amp; Order SVU,</i>

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.624
all 195 episodes of
<i> Law &amp; Order Criminal Intent,</i>

00:00:57.724 --> 00:01:00.960
and all 22 episodes
of<i> Law &amp; Order LA.</i>

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:04.263
As well as every episode
of<i> The Practice,</i>

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:07.800
<i> Ally McBeal, L.A. Law,
 Boston Legal, Night Court,</i>

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.937
<i> The Good Wife, Matlock, JAG,
 Perry Mason, Judging Amy,</i>

00:01:12.037 --> 00:01:13.907
<i> The Guardian,
 The Public Defender,</i>

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:15.741
<i> Owen Marshall:
 Counselor At Law,</i>

00:01:15.841 --> 00:01:19.845
<i>Harry's Law, Courthouse, Suits,
 Family Law, Sweet Justice,</i>

00:01:19.945 --> 00:01:23.315
1971's<i> The D.A.,</i>
2004's<i> The D.A.,</i>

00:01:23.415 --> 00:01:26.385
<i> Reasonable Doubts, Damages,
 Shark, The Defenders,</i>

00:01:26.485 --> 00:01:28.954
<i> The Paper Chase, Head Cases,
 Judd for the Defense,</i>

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:31.858
and all three episodes
of NBC's<i> First Years,</i>

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:34.560
and at that point, you're still
missing one lawsuit.

00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:36.729
-(AUDIENCE LAUGH)
-But, you've also basically

00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:38.965
run out of television shows
about lawyers,

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:42.869
meaning Trump's lawsuits exceed
the limits of the fucking genre!

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:44.370
(AUDIENCE LAUGH AND APPLAUD)

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:47.773
Well, lately...
Lately, there have been

00:01:47.973 --> 00:01:50.810
some new developments
with Trump-related litigation,

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.378
after he complained
about a judge

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:54.814
presiding over two
particular cases against him.

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:58.551 line:0%
I have judge who is
a hater of Donald Trump.

00:01:58.651 --> 00:01:59.985 line:0%
-A hater.
-(CROWD BOO)

00:02:00.085 --> 00:02:01.154 line:0%
He's a hater.

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:02.755 line:0%
His name is...

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:04.891 line:0%
Gonzalo Curiel.

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:07.660 line:0%
(CROWD BOO)

00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:11.898 line:0%
And he is not
doing the right thing.

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:15.067 line:0%
The judge who happens to be,
we believe, Mexican,

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:16.569 line:0%
which is great,
I think that's fine.

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:18.371
-Oh. Oh, you do, do you?
-(AUDIENCE LAUGH)

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:19.572
You think that's fine?

00:02:19.905 --> 00:02:21.607
Great news
people of Mexican descent,

00:02:21.707 --> 00:02:24.377
Donald Trump thinks it's fine
for you to be a human being

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:25.945
existing on this planet.

00:02:26.179 --> 00:02:27.546
Now, for the record,

00:02:27.646 --> 00:02:30.082
the judge in question
was born in Indiana,

00:02:30.182 --> 00:02:31.450
